    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/59b5f707c0ebea37f7b761395758c697.avif?t=1749550940\" data-has-big width=800 height=242 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world of flesh</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meat Engine</strong>\u00a0introduces you to a surrealist distant dystopian future where all aspects of science and logic and unrecognizable. Inspired by Scorn, Quake, Dusk and Doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring Music composed by <strong>Stan Magendanz</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/58ba95bbd394e6c274117ceb9d360a03.poster.avif?t=1749550940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/58ba95bbd394e6c274117ceb9d360a03.webm?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/58ba95bbd394e6c274117ceb9d360a03.mp4?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Meat Engine about?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One of the monarchs  has began to degrade, its control over its territory is weakening. With the monarch's wavering power over its subjects, chaos has overrun the land, bringing death and madness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Monarch can no longer be trusted and must be exterminated so that a new monarch may take its place. You play as a Stillborn, one of the many bioweapons, that have been tasked with eliminating the Monarch and bringing an end to the chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the ashes of the Monarch a new age will begin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is &quot;The Meat Engine&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Meat Engine is a planet sized sentient biomass, that scours the universe in an endless search for living matter. However, it is imperfect and often when absorbing other alien species they become liable for genetic mutation, which often leads to their savage desire to\u00a0destroy the Meat Engine. Thus, war ceaselessly\u00a0rages across the surface and within the endless tunnels of the Meat Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/7fcb144ae988a11db02e2a0e87880661.poster.avif?t=1749550940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/7fcb144ae988a11db02e2a0e87880661.webm?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/7fcb144ae988a11db02e2a0e87880661.mp4?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a large arsenal of <strong>biological and living weaponry</strong> to brutally eviscerate your foes, as you uncover the secrets of the <strong>Meat Engine</strong> and its mysterious origin. 8 unique weapons  are currently planned.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/b4833aa1594c8b3c8ebad2dfc9324b27.poster.avif?t=1749550940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/b4833aa1594c8b3c8ebad2dfc9324b27.webm?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/b4833aa1594c8b3c8ebad2dfc9324b27.mp4?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gory Retro Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meat Engine will feature a variety of surreal and diverse biological biomes for the player to explore. With\u00a08 unique levels at the full launch. New features and enemies are introduced with each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/59b5f707c0ebea37f7b761395758c697.avif?t=1749550940\" data-has-big width=800 height=242 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world of flesh</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meat Engine</strong>\u00a0introduces you to a surrealist distant dystopian future where all aspects of science and logic and unrecognizable. Inspired by Scorn, Quake, Dusk and Doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring Music composed by <strong>Stan Magendanz</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/58ba95bbd394e6c274117ceb9d360a03.poster.avif?t=1749550940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/58ba95bbd394e6c274117ceb9d360a03.webm?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/58ba95bbd394e6c274117ceb9d360a03.mp4?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Meat Engine about?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One of the monarchs  has began to degrade, its control over its territory is weakening. With the monarch's wavering power over its subjects, chaos has overrun the land, bringing death and madness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Monarch can no longer be trusted and must be exterminated so that a new monarch may take its place. You play as a Stillborn, one of the many bioweapons, that have been tasked with eliminating the Monarch and bringing an end to the chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the ashes of the Monarch a new age will begin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is &quot;The Meat Engine&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Meat Engine is a planet sized sentient biomass, that scours the universe in an endless search for living matter. However, it is imperfect and often when absorbing other alien species they become liable for genetic mutation, which often leads to their savage desire to\u00a0destroy the Meat Engine. Thus, war ceaselessly\u00a0rages across the surface and within the endless tunnels of the Meat Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/7fcb144ae988a11db02e2a0e87880661.poster.avif?t=1749550940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/7fcb144ae988a11db02e2a0e87880661.webm?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/7fcb144ae988a11db02e2a0e87880661.mp4?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a large arsenal of <strong>biological and living weaponry</strong> to brutally eviscerate your foes, as you uncover the secrets of the <strong>Meat Engine</strong> and its mysterious origin. 8 unique weapons  are currently planned.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/b4833aa1594c8b3c8ebad2dfc9324b27.poster.avif?t=1749550940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/b4833aa1594c8b3c8ebad2dfc9324b27.webm?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137010/extras/b4833aa1594c8b3c8ebad2dfc9324b27.mp4?t=1749550940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gory Retro Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meat Engine will feature a variety of surreal and diverse biological biomes for the player to explore. With\u00a08 unique levels at the full launch. New features and enemies are introduced with each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
